<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-NEW CAR REGISTRATIONS IN JULY UP TO 656 CARS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-NEW CAR REGISTRATIONS IN JULY UP TO 656 CARS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>New car registrations reached a new high in July of 656 units compared with 441 in June, the car registry office said on Monday.</p>
<p>The total numbers of cars registered so far this year is 2,664 units, the office said in a statement.  </p>
<p>The most popular new cars were Toyota with 450 registered followed by Nissan with 357 new cars on local roads.</p>
<p>The office gave no figures for the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +327 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
